{"id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-order-type.md","title":"Order Type","display":"df-order-type — Order Type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-order-type","aliases":["58-df-order-type"],"display":"df-order-type — Order Type","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-order-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-order-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-order-type — Order Type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"296e574c4ef84f16\" href=\"?note=296e574c4ef84f16\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md\">../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,&lt;)\">\\((A,&lt;)\\)</span> (ordered set), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> (ordinal candidate), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A\\to\\alpha\">\\(f:A\\to\\alpha\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S,\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S,\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\)</span> (order-type predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(R,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(R,X)\\)</span> 为严格良序，参数顺序为关系、载体；不调用自反良序接口。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}order\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,A,&lt;)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(&lt;,A)\\land\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,A,\\alpha)\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in{&lt;}\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in f(y)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}order\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,A,&lt;)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(&lt;,A)\\land\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,A,\\alpha)\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in{&lt;}\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in f(y)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ot}(A, &lt;)\">\\(\\mathrm{ot}(A, &lt;)\\)</span> is the unique ordinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> isomorphic to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A, &lt;)\">\\((A, &lt;)\\)</span></li>\n<li>This definition requires <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A, &lt;)\">\\((A, &lt;)\\)</span> to be a well-ordering</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"",